[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Military academies don't mess around. Even a simulated teacher takes things dead serious.",
        "Cv": 510031077.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Though honestly, getting kicked out is a pretty light punishment, don't you think?",
        "Cv": 510031078.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Still, it was a punishment... and I feel bad you got scolded because of me.",
        "Cv": 510031079.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "I found it rather amusing, actually.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Let's just try to pay better attention next time.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Commandant...",
        "Cv": 510031080.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "What if... what if I told you I pressed that button on purpose? Would you be upset?",
        "Cv": 510031081.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Why would you do that?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Not at all.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "I knew it... you are upset... I'm sorry.",
        "Cv": 510031082.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "I really didn't know what would happen... I just saw \"general course\" in small print under the button and thought it might have something to do with classes.",
        "Cv": 510031083.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "I figured it'd play a video or something, and then we could pretend to be classmates sitting through a lecture together.",
        "Cv": 510031084.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "But I never expected a full immersive sim, let alone such a strict teacher!",
        "Cv": 510031085.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Sorry for making you sit through something so boring.",
        "Cv": 510031086.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "The lecture was a bit dry, yes.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "I didn't find it boring at all.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Having you next to me made it worth it, Kamui.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Your reactions alone kept it entertaining, Kamui.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 19,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Really...?! I was really happy getting to be your deskmate, too, Commandant!",
        "Cv": 510031087.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 20,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "As long as I could keep you from being bored, that's what matters!",
        "Cv": 510031088.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 21,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Even if you hadn't pressed it, I probably would have.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 22,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Why's that?",
        "Cv": 510031089.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 23,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Do you actually enjoy general courses, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510031090.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 24,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "That wasn't it.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 25,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "It was because of you.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 26,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "I was planning to press the button anyway.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 27,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "I knew you were curious. Even a simulation seemed worth it.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 28,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Thank you, Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510031091.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 29,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "Not only did I get to experience a school class, but I also got to be your classmate! It totally made my day. Every moment with you feels like a new adventure.",
        "Cv": 510031092.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 30,
        "ActorName": "Kamui",
        "ActorTalk": "I want to keep getting to know you better. Let's go explore more together next time, \u3010kuroname\u3011!",
        "Cv": 510031093.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 31,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Hmm, let's go together.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    }
]